          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        },
        {
          "text": "The act of fighting with the fist; a combat with the fist; sparring. Blackstone. Boxing glove, a large padded mitten or glove used in sparring for exercise or amusement.",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        }
